### =====================================================================
### platform-service - ready-to-run requests
###
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and the IntelliJ HTTP Client.
### Calls the service DIRECTLY on port 8113, so we send the X-User-Id / X-User-Role headers
### ourselves (normally the API gateway adds them from the JWT).
###
### Seed: one settings row (INR, delivery 30.00, free from 299.00, minimum 99.00), four feature flags,
### three banners (the third one has ended). The full flow through the gateway: e2e/phase11-reports-and-platform.http
### =====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8113
@bannerId = {{newBanner.response.body.$.data.id}}


### 1. PUBLIC: currency, delivery fee, free delivery amount, minimum order, support contact
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/platform/settings


### 2. PUBLIC: feature switches for the apps
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/platform/feature-flags


### 3. PUBLIC: home page banners shown right now (ended or inactive ones are left out)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/banners


### 4. SUPER_ADMIN (user 1): change the settings -> PlatformSettingsChanged (cart-service uses them a moment later)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/settings
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN

{
  "currency": "INR",
  "deliveryFee": 35.00,
  "freeDeliveryFrom": 349.00,
  "minimumOrderValue": 99.00,
  "supportEmail": "support@grocery.com",
  "supportPhone": "1800-123-4567"
}


### 5. SUPER_ADMIN: minimum order above the free delivery amount -> 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/settings
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN

{
  "currency": "INR",
  "deliveryFee": 35.00,
  "freeDeliveryFrom": 99.00,
  "minimumOrderValue": 149.00,
  "supportEmail": "support@grocery.com",
  "supportPhone": "1800-123-4567"
}


### 6. SUPER_ADMIN: invalid values -> 400 with one error per field
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/settings
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN

{
  "currency": "rupees",
  "deliveryFee": -5,
  "freeDeliveryFrom": 299.00,
  "minimumOrderValue": 99.00,
  "supportEmail": "not-an-email",
  "supportPhone": ""
}


### 7. SUPER_ADMIN: put the settings back
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/settings
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN

{
  "currency": "INR",
  "deliveryFee": 30.00,
  "freeDeliveryFrom": 299.00,
  "minimumOrderValue": 99.00,
  "supportEmail": "support@grocery.com",
  "supportPhone": "1800-123-4567"
}


### 8. SUPER_ADMIN: all feature flags
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/feature-flags
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN


### 9. SUPER_ADMIN: a new flag for a new city (off until the launch)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/feature-flags
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN

{
  "key": "CITY_PUNE_{{$randomInt 100 999}}",
  "description": "Stores and customers in Pune can use the app",
  "enabled": false
}


### 10. SUPER_ADMIN: switch delivery slots on
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/feature-flags/DELIVERY_SLOTS
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN

{
  "enabled": true
}


### 11. SUPER_ADMIN: ...and off again
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/feature-flags/DELIVERY_SLOTS
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN

{
  "enabled": false
}


### 12. SUPER_ADMIN: unknown flag -> 404
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/feature-flags/NO_SUCH_FLAG
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN

{
  "enabled": true
}


### 13. ADMIN (user 2): all banners, with "live" = shown right now
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/banners
X-User-Id: 2
X-User-Role: ADMIN


### 14. ADMIN: a banner for one week of November
# @name newBanner
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/banners
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 2
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{
  "title": "Organic week",
  "subtitle": "15 % off organic vegetables",
  "imageUrl": "http://localhost:8080/media/banners/organic.jpg",
  "linkUrl": "/categories/1",
  "position": 4,
  "startsAt": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-16T00:00:00Z",
  "active": true
}


### 15. ADMIN: end before start -> 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/banners/{{bannerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 2
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{
  "title": "Organic week",
  "imageUrl": "http://localhost:8080/media/banners/organic.jpg",
  "position": 4,
  "startsAt": "2026-11-16T00:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
  "active": true
}


### 16. ADMIN: remove it
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/banners/{{bannerId}}
X-User-Id: 2
X-User-Role: ADMIN


### 17. SUPER_ADMIN: the audit log of changes made here (settings, flags, banners)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/audit-log?source=platform-service
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN


### 18. SUPER_ADMIN: every OrderCancelled event of the platform
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/audit-log?eventType=OrderCancelled
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN


### 19. SUPER_ADMIN: everything about order 1 (the Kafka key is the order id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/audit-log?aggregateId=1&sort=occurredAt,asc
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN


### 20. SUPER_ADMIN: everything of store 1 since 1 Oct 2026
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/audit-log?storeId=1&from=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN


### ---------- Dead letters: events that failed after all retries (docs/resilience.md, "Dead letters") ----------

### 21. SUPER_ADMIN: every dead-letter topic and how many messages it keeps (30 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/dead-letters
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN


### 22. SUPER_ADMIN: the newest failed order events: the event, the error, partition + offset, replayed or not
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/dead-letters/grocery.order.events.DLT?limit=20
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN


### 23. SUPER_ADMIN: after fixing the cause, send ONE message back to grocery.order.events (partition + offset from 22)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/dead-letters/grocery.order.events.DLT/replay
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN

{
  "partition": 0,
  "offset": 0
}


### 24. SUPER_ADMIN: send back EVERY message of the topic that was not replayed yet (at most 500 per call)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/dead-letters/grocery.order.events.DLT/replay
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN

{
  "all": true
}


### 25. SUPER_ADMIN: every replay so far (who and when)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super-admin/audit-log?eventType=DeadLetterReplayed
X-User-Id: 1
X-User-Role: SUPER_ADMIN
